## Port Management

Portier manages all port conflicts automatically. Key workflows:
- `portier scan` — check for port conflicts before starting servers
- `portier assign .` — auto-assign free ports to this project
- `portier start` — scan + assign + update all in one command
- `portier run -- <cmd>` — prevent EADDRINUSE with transparent proxy
- `portier daemon` — background auto-healer (optional)

Always check `portier scan` before starting a dev server. If port 3000
is taken, Portier will find and configure a free port automatically.
